imately 520 (450) GeV are excluded for $\\tilde{t}_{2}$ masses of 650 (800) GeV , extending beyond the previous limits on the $\\tilde{\\chi}^{0}_{1}$ mass from Ref. [ 89 ] by up to 160 GeV.\"}"}, {"paper_id": "2006.05880", "qid": "gf-14", "answer": true, "quote": "extending beyond the previous limits on the stop mass from Ref. [ 89 ] by up to 160 GeV.", "quote_verified": true, "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "extending beyond the previous limits on the stop mass from Ref. [ 89 ] by up to 160 GeV.", "section": "Results", "window": 9, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"found\": true, \"answer\": \"extending beyond the previous limits on the stop mass from Ref. [ 89 ] by up to 160 GeV.\", \"quote\": \"extending beyond the previous limits on the stop mass from Ref. [ 89 ] by up to 160 GeV.\"}\n```"}]}
